<Page title="About"><main id="main" class="reading-page" tabindex="-1"><section class="page-intro"><h1>About the Atlas</h1><p class="lede">A source-linked reference for critical mineral deposits and mines, starting with rare earths, nickel and cobalt.</p></section>
<section class="editorial-row"><h2>Purpose</h2><div><p>The Atlas helps readers identify a site, understand its development stage and check the evidence behind a claim. The map, country profiles and mineral profiles share a versioned source register.</p><p>Descriptions use the publisher’s dates, classifications and terminology. The Atlas distinguishes documented facts from unresolved questions.</p></div></section>
<section class="editorial-row" id="corrections"><h2>Report an error</h2><div><p>For this private release, send corrections to the Atlas maintainer through the channel where you received preview access. Include the release tag, site ID or source record ID, the field to review, and a supporting publisher citation.</p><p><a href="/sources/">Source register</a> · <a href="/downloads/">Release downloads</a></p></div></section>
</main></Page>
